  "description": "Installation of an External AC Unit in the rear garden and within the boundary of the property. ",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Any existing plant (Daikin RXM35R5V1B9 external air conditioning unit) installed, together with any associated ancillary equipment, so as to prevent the transmission of noise and vibration into neighbouring premises. The rated noise level from the plant and ancillary equipment shall not exceed the existing background sound level (LA90,15mins) when measured (LAeq,15mins) 1 metre external from the nearest residential or noise sensitive premises. An assessment of the expected noise levels shall be carried out by a suitably qualified (IOA accredited) and experienced acoustic consultant, in accordance with BS 4142:2014+A1:2019 ‘Methods for rating and assessing industrial and commercial sound,’ and any mitigation measures necessary to achieve the above required noise levels shall be submitted to the Local Planning Authority in writing for approval.The plant shall thereafter be permanently retained and maintained in working order for the duration of the use and its operation.Reason: To protect the amenities of adjoining occupiers and the surrounding area.",
    "<p>The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this permission.</p><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\nREASON: In order to comply with the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).</p><p>\r\n</p>",
    "Noise levels from fixed plant and machinery associated with the proposed development must be 10dB(A) or more below the background noise level when measured at 1m from any nearby noise sensitive premises at any time. The fixed plant and machinery shall be retained and maintained as recommended by the supplier/manufacturer for the duration of its use.Reason: To protect the amenities of adjoining occupiers and the surrounding area.",
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>"
  ],
